# 📘 LMS Platform — Technical PRD (v1)

## 1. Product Overview

### Goal

Build a scalable **marketing + commerce + enrollment platform** for an LMS ecosystem with:

* Multi-domain learning (AI, Biotechnology, Nanotechnology, etc.)
* Structured product catalog
* Role-based dashboards
* Payment + enrollment automation
* Integration with Moodle (learning delivery)
* Intelligent search & recommendations

---

## 2. System Architecture

### High-Level Architecture

```txt
[ Next.js Frontend ]
        |
        | (API Routes / Backend Layer)
        |
[ Application Server (Node.js) ]
        |
        ├── PostgreSQL (Core Data)
        ├── Payload CMS (Content + Admin)
        ├── Redis (Caching, sessions, queues)
        ├── Search Engine (Meilisearch/Typesense)
        ├── Razorpay (Payments)
        └── Moodle (LMS via APIs)
```

