# 5. Database Schema (PostgreSQL)

## 5.1 Users

```sql
users (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  name TEXT,
  email TEXT UNIQUE,
  password_hash TEXT,
  role ENUM('admin','mentor','participant','program_manager'),
  created_at TIMESTAMP,
  updated_at TIMESTAMP
)
```

---

## 5.2 Domains

```sql
domains (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  name TEXT,
  slug TEXT UNIQUE,
  description TEXT,
  created_at TIMESTAMP
)
