# 7. Payment Flow (Critical)

## Flow

```txt
User → Click Enroll
      → Create Razorpay Order
      → Payment Success
      → Razorpay Webhook
      → Verify Signature
      → Create Enrollment
      → Enroll in Moodle
      → Generate Invoice
      → Send Confirmation
```

⚠️ Always trust **webhook**, not frontend response.

