# 8. Moodle Integration

## Required APIs

* Create user (if not exists)
* Enroll user in course
* Fetch completion status
* Fetch certificate

## Integration Strategy

* Store `moodle_course_id` in product
* Trigger enrollment via backend
* Sync completion via cron or webhook

